<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CommitMate | 완벽한 행동 설계</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0e0f11;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --text-muted: #555;
            --danger: #f87171;
            --green: #34d399;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }

        /* ── Header ── */
        header {
            height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky; top: 0;
            background: rgba(14,15,17,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px); z-index: 100;
        }
        .header-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .logo { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
        .logo span { color: var(--danger); }

        nav { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
            padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 8px; transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .nav-link:hover { color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
        .btn-signup-sm {
            background: #fff; color: #0e0f11;
            padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-signup-sm:hover { background: #e0e0e0; }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero { padding: 100px 0 80px; text-align: center; }
        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(248,113,113,0.08);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25);
            padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 100px;
            font-size: 12px; color: var(--danger); font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .hero-badge::before {
            content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px;
            background: var(--danger); border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 72px);
            font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -2px; color: #fff;
        }
        .hero h1 span { color: var(--danger); }
        .hero p {
            color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 17px;
            max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 48px; line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .btn-cta {
            background: var(--danger); color: #fff;
            padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-cta:hover { background: #f95e5e; transform: translateY(-2px); }

        /* ── 기능 소개 ── */
        .features { padding: 80px 0; }
        .section-eyebrow {
            font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--danger); margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800;
            text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .section-sub {
            text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: #111214;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(248,113,113,0.3);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }
        .feature-icon {
            width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(248,113,113,0.08);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.2);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }
        .feature-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }

        /* ── 흐름 섹션 ── */
        .flow { padding: 80px 0; background: #0a0b0d; }
        .flow-steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 0; margin-top: 56px; position: relative;
        }
        .flow-step {
            text-align: center; padding: 32px 24px; position: relative;
        }
        .flow-step:not(:last-child)::after {
            content: '→';
            position: absolute; right: -12px; top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: #333; font-size: 20px;
        }
        .step-num {
            width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(248,113,113,0.1);
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.3);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--danger);
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
        }
        .flow-step h4 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .flow-step p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

        /* ── CTA 섹션 ── */
        .cta-section {
            padding: 100px 0; text-align: center;
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
        }
        .cta-section h2 {
            font-size: 40px; font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .cta-section h2 span { color: var(--danger); }
        .cta-section p {
            color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            color: #aaa; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none; transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #fff; }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        footer {
            padding: 48px 0; text-align: center;
            color: #2a2a2a; font-size: 12px;
            border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="container header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Commit<span>Mate</span>.</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="/login-form" class="nav-link">로그인</a>
            <a href="/signup-form" class="btn-signup-sm">회원가입</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-badge">그룹 기반 벌금형 목표 관리 서비스</div>
        <h1>의지가 흔들린다면<br><span>지갑</span>을 거세요.</h1>
        <p>그룹을 만들고 미션을 등록하세요.<br>
            실패하면 벌금, 성공하면 성취감.<br>
            투명한 정산으로 팀의 목표를 완성합니다.</p>
        <a href="/signup-form" class="btn-cta">지금 무료로 시작하기</a>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 기능 소개 -->
<section class="features">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">FEATURES</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">CommitMate가 제공하는 것들</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">목표 달성을 위한 모든 것을 갖췄습니다.</p>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
                <h3>그룹 관리</h3>
                <p>그룹을 만들고 초대 링크 또는 가입 코드로 팀원을 초대하세요. 총무가 그룹을 관리하고 멤버를 강퇴할 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
                <h3>미션 등록</h3>
                <p>그룹 내에서 미션을 등록하고 마감 기한을 설정하세요. 기한 내 완료하지 못하면 벌금이 부과됩니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⏰</div>
                <h3>마감 알림</h3>
                <p>프로그레스 바를 통해 마감까지 남은 시간을 한눈에 확인하세요. 임박할수록 경고 색상으로 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">💸</div>
                <h3>벌금 정산</h3>
                <p>미션 실패 시 벌금이 자동으로 등록됩니다. 납부 신청 후 총무의 승인을 통해 투명하게 정산됩니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
                <h3>소셜 로그인</h3>
                <p>Google 계정으로 간편하게 시작하세요. 별도의 회원가입 없이 바로 그룹에 참여할 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔑</div>
                <h3>초대 시스템</h3>
                <p>초대 링크를 공유하거나 6자리 가입 코드를 전달해 팀원을 초대하세요. 두 가지 방식으로 편리하게 참여할 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 서비스 흐름 -->
<section class="flow">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">이렇게 사용하세요</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">4단계로 목표를 완성하세요.</p>

        <div class="flow-steps">
            <div class="flow-step">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <h4>그룹 생성</h4>
                <p>그룹을 만들고<br>팀원을 초대하세요</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
                <div class="step-num">2</div>
                <h4>미션 등록</h4>
                <p>마감 기한과<br>벌금을 설정하세요</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
                <div class="step-num">3</div>
                <h4>미션 수행</h4>
                <p>기한 내 미션을<br>완료하세요</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
                <div class="step-num">4</div>
                <h4>벌금 정산</h4>
                <p>실패 시 납부 신청 후<br>총무 승인으로 정산</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>지금 바로 <span>시작</span>하세요</h2>
        <p>팀원들과 함께 목표를 세우고<br>서로의 의지를 지켜주세요.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
            <a href="/signup-form" class="btn-cta">회원가입하기</a>
            <a href="/login-form" class="btn-secondary">로그인</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>COMMITMATE — NO MORE EXCUSES. JUST RESULTS.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 8px;">© 2026 CommitMate. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>